  "goodToKnow": "Das Fahrverbot is a driving ban: einen Monat Fahrverbot, for example for speeding over 31 km/h in town. Unlike a Führerscheinentzug (licence revoked), the licence is handed back after the ban. Penalty points are recorded at the Kraftfahrt-Bundesamt in Flensburg: Punkte in Flensburg. Cities like Stuttgart introduced Dieselfahrverbote after the 2018 court ruling. Plural: die Fahrverbote."
